A tier schema mdcheck cannot load (an unknown key) is one `schema` error on the schema file,
carrying mdcheck's first stderr line; that type's records are not schema-checked, and the
`_schemas/` directory of a tier not rooted at the vault is neither records nor a layout finding.

-- fixtures/xdg/booping/config.yaml --
core:
  specs:
    tiers:
      global:
        namespace: owner
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_specs/_schemas/rule.yaml --
doc: rule
bogus: 1
rules: []
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_specs/rule/0001-keep-it-short.md --
---
type: rule
title: Keep it short
summary: Cut what the reader does not need.
created_by: owner
created_at: 2026-01-01
updated_at: 2026-01-01
status: accepted
---

